OL,3,GNEWSAPost Office barrister to lead
OL,4,Asecond Arday review
OL,5,
OL,6,FA barrister says a review examining
OL,7,FCambridge University's response to
OL,8,Fallegations of research misconduct
OL,9,Ffollowing the death of Prof Jason Arday
OL,10,Fmay raise "difficult and uncomfortable
OL,11,Fissues".
OL,13,FJason Beer KC - who was lead barrister
OL,14,Ffor the Post Office Horizon scandal
OL,15,Finquiry - will chair the second part of
OL,16,Fthe university's independent review.
OL,18,FArday, 41, resigned from his post as
OL,19,Fprofessor of sociology of education at
OL,20,Fthe university after he faced intense
OL,21,Fscrutiny over accusations of
OL,22,Fplagiarism.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
